o the first value to assign it. Additionally, an uninitialized variable and an exporting variable that has been initialized with the first enumeration value look exactly the same in the inspector, which can be confusing for users.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b139ba2c-0e1d-4afa-8415-3487e87a1a02\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\n\nextends Node\n\nenum Numbers {\n\tTEN = 10,\n\tFIVE = 5,\n}\n\n@export var assigned_enum_var: Numbers = Numbers.TEN\n@export var unassigned_enum_var: Numbers\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tprints(assigned_enum_var, unassigned_enum_var)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nEasy to reproduce, no need MRP.","closed_by":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102711/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102711/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}